<title>FRANCE: Juppe to see Renault head at 1630 GMT.</title>
<headline>Juppe to see Renault head at 1630 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Prime Minister Alain Juppe will meet Renault head Louis Schweitzer at 1630 GMT on Wednesday, an official at Juppe's office said.</p>
<p>Schweitzer would be accompanied by Renault general secretary Michel de Virville.</p>
<p>Juppe would ask them to inform him about the method used by the group to decide on the closure of the Vilvoorde plant in Belgium as well as its plans on possible talks with everybody involved. He would also discuss job cuts planned in France.</p>
</text>
